{"id":"9871b3f02563bee2","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-ground-fragment-closed.md","title":"归约保持基项","display":"thm-ground-fragment-closed — 归约保持基项","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-ground-fragment-closed","aliases":["56-thm-ground-fragment-closed"],"display":"thm-ground-fragment-closed — 归约保持基项","depends_on":["[[56-df-closed-fragment]]","[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), §3.4.1 ground-fragment closure, printed p75","source_ocr_block":"96","verification_status":"source-claim-compared; local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-ground-fragment-closed"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-ground-fragment-closed</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ground-fragment-closed — 归约保持基项"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4756bc85be4e874\" href=\"?note=b4756bc85be4e874\" title=\"56-df-closed-fragment\">56-df-closed-fragment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98838138a402c043\" href=\"?note=98838138a402c043\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-rule\">56-df-rewrite-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §3.4.1 ground-fragment closure, printed p75"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"96"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-claim-compared; local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\">\\(G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^*\">\\(\\to_R^*\\)</span> 是有限步闭包。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\in G\\land s\\to_R t\\Longrightarrow t\\in G),\\qquad\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\in G\\land s\\to_R^*t\\Longrightarrow t\\in G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\in G\\land s\\to_R t\\Longrightarrow t\\in G),\\qquad\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\in G\\land s\\to_R^*t\\Longrightarrow t\\in G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.4.1（印刷 p75，OCR 页块96）的闭项片段说明。一步证明：若基项 s 的子项为 lσ，则 l 中实际出现的每个变量都被替换为基项；由 Var(r)⊆Var(l)，rσ 也是基项。外部上下文原本来自基项，故替换后仍无变量。有限步结论按步数归纳。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-closed-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"b4756bc85be4e874","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-closed-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-rule","status":"resolved","id":"98838138a402c043","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\in G\\land s\\to_R t\\Longrightarrow t\\in G),\\qquad\\forall s,t\\in T\\;(s\\in G\\land s\\to_R^*t\\Longrightarrow t\\in G).","display":true}],"bytes":1187,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-268","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-ground-fragment-closed.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b4756bc85be4e874","98838138a402c043","6aa7f56f36c897f4"]}